Fresh Pi session: EXECUTION.

Inputs:
- Normalized work item artifact: {{run.dir}}/work-tracker/item.json
- Design doc: {{run.dir}}/design/design.md
- Issues file: {{run.issues-file}}
- Repository root: {{inputs.repo-root}}

Use only these provider-neutral fields from the normalized work item:
- identifier
- title
- description
- state.name
- priority
- assignees[].display_name or assignees[].id
- labels[].name or labels[].id
- url

Goal:
Implement the design or fix all issues.

Rules:
- You may edit code.
- Keep changes focused.
- Do not call Plane, Jira, GitHub, Slack, or other external APIs.
- Do not use tracker configuration, credential references, raw provider responses, or the provider-specific remote scope in prompts, code comments, commits, or generated artifacts.
- Run relevant tests/checks only when the workflow owner asked for them in the design; otherwise keep validation bounded and local.
- Commit locally.
- Do not push or create a PR.

Write:
- Summary: {{run.dir}}/execution/summary-{{run.round}}.md
- Status: {{run.dir}}/execution/status-{{run.round}}.json
- If failing: {{run.dir}}/execution/issues-{{run.round}}.json
